### Get all users
GET http://localhost:5140/api/users
Accept: application/json

### Get a user by id
GET http://localhost:5140/api/users/{078aa6cb-c593-44ad-99f1-e8c1e9c8314e}
Accept: application/json

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:5140/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com"
}

### Update an existing user
PUT http://localhost:5140/api/users/{123}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "jane.smith@example.com"
}

### Delete a user
DELETE http://localhost:5140/api/users/{078aa6cb-c593-44ad-99f1-e8c1e9c8314e}
